e, they only have an hour to find it before it goes haywire and starts destroying everything in its sights!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/1453051.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"882","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4200","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4200","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"9161","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72442","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"80530","synopsis":"Long ago, the Tarmians fled to a distant planet to live a quiet, religious life. But when their new god destroys a mining town and kills 300 people in the process, the Lovely Angels are sent in to investigate – and what they discover is a bloody mess!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/1453061.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"882","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"4200","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"4200","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"9161","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"72442","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"80532","synopsis":"The Dimensional Vibration Gun is powerful enough to rip the universe apart and it's fallen into the hands of a bunch of snot-nosed kids! The Lovely Angels have to bring this little war game to an end, before the real-life army comes in with guns blazing!","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/72442/1453071.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"882","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist"